        "text": "设两根为 $p, \\frac{1}{p} (p \\neq 1)$ ，由 $G(p) = G\\left(\\frac{1}{p}\\right)$ 得 $(p - 1)\\ln p + (b - 1)p - 1 = \\left(\\frac{1}{p} - 1\\right)\\ln \\frac{1}{p} + (b - 1)\\frac{1}{p} - 1$",
